WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.594
Aa chhe Hisaab.

00:00:01.524 --> 00:00:06.451
Bharatiya business maate accounting,
TallyPrime ni jaanit keys sathe.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:12.746
Tamara chopda tamara potana PC par. Koi
account nahi. Free.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.649
Tally mathi ek step ma switch karo.

00:00:15.579 --> 00:00:19.215
Hisaab darek master ane darek voucher vanche
chhe,

00:00:19.145 --> 00:00:23.057
ane saabit kare chhe ke darek balance match
thay chhe.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:26.580
Enter dabavo, ane company aavi jaay chhe.

00:00:27.281 --> 00:00:31.231
Proof of Match batave chhe ke darek line match
thay chhe.

00:00:34.231 --> 00:00:38.335
Saacha TallyPrime sathe test: 736 vouchers,

00:00:38.265 --> 00:00:42.176
aashre 12 seconds ma switch thaya, Proof of
Match sathe.

00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:47.171
V thi vouchers khule chhe. F8 etle sales
invoice.

00:00:47.201 --> 00:00:53.268
Naam no thodo bhaag lakho, ane Enter dabavo:
party, items, quantity.

00:00:53.298 --> 00:00:57.567
Hisaab darek item na rate parthi GST gane
chhe.

00:01:00.348 --> 00:01:02.506
B thi Balance Sheet khule chhe.

00:01:03.207 --> 00:01:09.087
Enter thi andar jao: Profit & Loss, stock, ane
darek item sudhi.

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:17.878
Tamara GST returns, GSTR-1 ane GSTR-3B, sidha
tamara vouchers parthi aave chhe.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:23.855
Alt G, GSTR-1: navu invoice B2B table ma aavi
gayu chhe.

00:01:24.935 --> 00:01:27.684
Darroj Hisaab jaate backup le chhe.

00:01:29.935 --> 00:01:35.339
F9 thi, Hisaab Drive tamara potana cloud ma
copy rakhe chhe.

00:01:36.419 --> 00:01:39.796
Hindi ke Gujarati ma screen, e j keys sathe.

00:01:41.128 --> 00:01:45.623
Release page parthi Hisaab download karo, ane
aaje j sharu karo.

